We have new content in the game! In the store, we now have the [b]Steam cards[/b], in addition to [b]emojis[/b], [b]wallpapers[/b], and [b]themed badges[/b] for customization. ❤🌵
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33252395/7c21204654b1d14fafada18c907fa4d7825160de.gif[/img]
[h2]Check out the complete list of the update:[/h2]
[list]
[*] 3 new quests;
[*] New items;
[*] New achievements;
[*] New game balancing;
[*] Steam trading cards;
[*] ÁRIDA emojis;
[*] ÁRIDA and Aoca Game Lab wallpapers;
[*] ÁRIDA badges;
[/list]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33252395/29897cb16b4cd3a0465f46f357ff87fb3264a2d9.gif[/img]
If you've played, try this new trip to the backlands! 
And choose a loved one to give a copy!

[b]If you haven't played yet, here's a great opportunity! [/b]
